      "description": "<p><strong>BACK BY POPULAR DEMAND \ud83e\udea1\ud83c\udf78</strong></p>\n<p>Join us for a <strong>Sip and Stitch at Broken Records in Brighton!</strong></p>\n<p>Our Sip and Stitch events have been incredibly popular, and we\u2019re excited to bring the experience to Broken Records for an evening of needlepoint, drinks, and good company.</p>\n<p>Whether you\u2019re a seasoned stitcher or picking up a needle for the first time, all experience levels are welcome! <strong>Members of the Modern Mesh team will be walking around throughout the event to check in, answer questions, and help you along the way.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>YOUR TICKET INCLUDES:</strong><br />\ud83c\udf78 1 drink ticket<br />\ud83e\uddf5 Your choice of canvas + complete stitching kit<br />\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Raffles + giveaways<br />\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Exclusive Modern Mesh discount for future purchases</p>\n<p><strong>All levels of needlepoint expertise are welcome!</strong></p>\n<p>\ud83d\udccd <strong>Broken Records, Brighton</strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><i>Cancellation Policy: Cancellations made within 48 hours of the event are non-refundable. If you\u2019re unable to attend and cancel within this window, we\u2019ll mail your selected canvas and kit to you instead.</i></p>",
